OL,3,ABurnham wants Neets report to be
OL,4,Awatershed moment, No 10 says, as Tories
OL,5,Acriticise welfare and tax proposals
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the Conservatives' Helen Whately
OL,8,Fsays the "lion's share" of what's
OL,9,Frecommended is a "massive spending
OL,10,Fplan"
OL,12,FWhat we're hearing from you: Ffion, 24,
OL,13,Fsays she is "losing hope" after
OL,14,Fapplying for 100 jobs since June and
OL,15,Fgetting just three interviews, while
OL,16,FEwan, 22, encourages people to apply
OL,17,Ffor apprenticeships
OL,19,FIn Bournemouth, cafe owner Ben worries
OL,20,Fabout the costs of taking on young
OL,21,Fpeople: "Our margins have been squeezed
OL,22,Fand squeezed and squeezed"
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
