OL,3,APalestinian woman, 72, shot dead by
OL,4,AIsraeli settlers in West Bank, health
OL,5,Aministry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Palestinian woman in her 70s has been
OL,8,Fshot dead, and several other people
OL,9,Fwounded, in a village in the occupied
OL,10,FWest Bank where Israeli settlers
OL,11,Frecently moved in, the Palestinian
OL,12,Fhealth ministry says.
OL,14,FThere are conflicting accounts of what
OL,15,Fhappened. Local Palestinians said there
OL,16,Fwas an attack by settlers in part of
OL,17,Fal-Duyuk al-Tahta, near Jericho, which
OL,18,Fis meant to be under the full control
OL,19,Fof the Palestinian Authority.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
