OL,3,APalestinian woman, 72, shot dead by
OL,4,AIsraeli settlers in West Bank, health
OL,5,Aministry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAccording to the Israeli army, there
OL,8,Fwas a Palestinian car-ramming attack on
OL,9,Fan Israeli vehicle. It said rocks were
OL,10,Fthen thrown at the Israelis, who opened
OL,11,Ffire in response. It did not mention
OL,12,Fthe fatal shooting of a woman.
OL,14,FThere have been high tensions in the
OL,15,Farea since a group of settlers recently
OL,16,Fset up a new outpost.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
